      "text": "FDA's records show doxorubicin hydrochloride is not on the drug shortage list as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 105 vials of the 2 mg/mL 10 mL presentation with 3.2 vials used per day, providing 33.1 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D1"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale General holds 65 vials of the same presentation with 2.8 vials used per day, providing 23.2 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The top-ranked purchasing option is to buy from Amneal Pharmaceuticals LLC, which is not on FDA's shortage list today and is manufactured at Amneal Oncology Pvt. Ltd. Telangana 509301.",
      "cites": ["D4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A second option is to buy from Baxter Healthcare Corporation, also not on FDA's shortage list today, with its plant Eurofins Biolab Srl last inspected VAI on 2024-09-13.",
      "cites": ["D5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A third option is to buy from Gland Pharma Limited, not on FDA's shortage list today, with its plant last inspected NAI on 2023-07-28.",
